{"url": "https://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Home.html", "html": "<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n\n<!--Coding in the head section does not appeat on the website, use it to set styles etc.-->\n\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"iWeb 1.1.2\" />\n<META HTTP-EQUIV=\"Pragma\" CONTENT=\"no-cache\"><META HTTP-EQUIV=\"Expires\" CONTENT=\"-1\"> <!--This tag makes the page refresh automatically on each visit, meaning the cache is cleared and no ghost pages!-->\n\n<title>Bishop Lab Home</title>\n\n<style>\nbody {\n\twidth:100%;\n\tmargin:0 auto;\n\tpadding:0;\n\tbackground:#000000;\n\tcolor:#000000;\n\tfont-family:\"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n\tdisplay:block;\n\tfont-size:16px;\n}\n.banner {\n\twidth:100%;\n\theight:300px;\n\tmargin:0px auto;\n\tbackground-image:url(General/New%20Home%20Banner.jpg);\n\tbackground-size:auto;\n\tbackground-repeat:no-repeat;\n\tbackground-position:center;\n\tposition:absolute;\n\ttop:5px;\n}\n.ContentWrap {\n\twidth:100%;\n\theight:auto;\n\tposition:absolute;\n\ttop:390px;\n}\n.Content {\n\twidth:1000px;\n\tcolor:#CCCCCC;\n\tmargin:0 auto;\n\theight:auto;\n\tposition:relative;\n}\n.Title {\n\tfont-size:26px;\n\tcolor:#CCCCCC;\n}\n.Text {\n\tfont-size:20px;\n\tcolor:#CCCCCC;\n\ttext-align:justify;\n}\n.HalfRight {\n\twidth:670px;\n\tfloat:Right;\n\theight:auto;\n}\n.HalfRightWrap {\n\twidth:670px;\n\tfloat:Right;\n\theight:850px;\n\toverflow-y:scroll;\n}\n.HalfWrapSpace {\n\tPadding-right:10px;\n}\n.HalfLeft {\n\twidth:300px;\n\tfloat:Left;\n\theight:auto;\n}\na.nav-link:link {\n   color: #000000;\n   text-decoration: none;\n}\na.nav-link:visited {\n   color:#000000;\n   text-decoration: none;\n}\na.nav-link:hover {\n   color:#900;\n   text-decoration:underline;\n}\na.nav-link:active {\n   color: #000000;\n   text-decoration: none;\n}\na.nav-link_inline:link {\n   color: #999;\n   text-decoration:none;\n   font-style:italic;\n   font-weight:bold;\n   font-size:20px;\n}\na.nav-link_inline:visited {\n   color:#999;\n   text-decoration: none;\n   font-style:italic;\n   font-weight:bold;\n   font-size:20px;\n}\na.nav-link_inline:hover {\n   color:#0F0;\n   text-decoration:underline;\n   font-style:italic;\n   font-weight:bold;\n   font-size:20px;\n}\na.nav-link_inline:active {\n   color: #999;\n   text-decoration: none;\n   font-style:italic;\n   font-weight:bold;\n   font-size:20px;\n}\n.clearfix:after {\n    display:block;\n    clear:both;\n}\n/*----- Menu Outline -----*/\n.menu-wrap {\n    width:100%;\n\theight:auto;\n\tposition:absolute;\n\ttop:305px;\n}\n.menu {\n    width:1000px;\n    margin:0px auto;\n}\n.menu li {\n    margin:0px;\n    list-style:none;\n}\n.menu a {\n    transition:all linear 0.15s;\n    color:#CCCCCC;\n\ttext-decoration:none;\n}\n.menu li:hover > a, .menu .current-item > a {\n    text-decoration:underline;\n    color:#000000;\n}\n.menu .arrow {\n    font-size:11px;\n    line-height:0%;\n}\n/*----- Top Level -----*/\n.menu > ul > li {\n    float:left;\n    display:inline-block;\n\tposition:relative;\n    font-size:20px;\n}\n.menu > ul > li > a {\n    padding:20px 20px;\n\tdisplay:inline-block;\n}\n.menu > ul > li:hover > a, .menu > ul > .current-item > a {\n    background:#999;\n\tborder:medium #000;\n\tborder-radius:5px;\n}\n/*----- Bottom Level -----*/\n.menu li:hover .sub-menu {\n    z-index:1;\n    opacity:1;\n}\n.sub-menu {\n    width:350px;\n    padding:0px 0px;\n    position:absolute;\n    top:100%;\n    left:0px;\n    z-index:-1;\n    opacity:0;\n    transition:opacity linear 0.15s;\n    background:#999;\n\tborder:medium #000;\n\tborder-radius:5px;\n}\n.sub-menu li {\n    display:block;\n    font-size:16px;\n}\n.sub-menu li a {\n    padding:10px 30px;\n    display:block;\n\tcolor:#000000;\n}\n.sub-menu li a:hover, .sub-menu .current-item a {\n    background:#999;\n\tborder:medium #000;\n\tborder-radius:5px;\n}\n</style>\n\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"menu-wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"menu\">\n        <ul class=\"clearfix\">\n            <li>\n            \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Home.html\">Home</a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n                <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Research.html\">Research <span class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</span></a>\n                <ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n                    <li>\n                    \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Research.html#Salamander_Algae_Symbiosis\">Salamander-Algae Symbiosis</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                    \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Research.html#Sea_Urchin_Evolutionary_Development\">Sea Urchin Evolutionary Development</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                    \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Research.html#Anti_Fouling\">Environmentally Friendly Anti Fouling</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                    \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Research.html#Publications\">Publications</a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n            \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/People.html\">People<span class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</span></a>\n                <ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n                    <li>\n                    \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/People.html#CurrentLabMembers\">Current Lab Members</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                    \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/People.html#PreviousStudents\">Previous Students</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                    \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/People.html#Collaborators\">Collaborators</a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n            \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Students.html\">Students and Teaching<span class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</span></a>\n                <ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n                    <li>\n                    \t <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Students.html#Opportunities\">Student Opportunities</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                    \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Students.html#Teaching\">Teaching Activities</a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n            \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Outreach.html\">Citizen Science</a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n            \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Gallery.html\">Gallery</a>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n            \t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Contact Us.html\">Contact Us</a>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"banner\">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ContentWrap\">\n\t<div class=\"Content\">\n    \t<hr />\n    \t<div class=\"HalfLeft\">\n            <img src=\"General/Logo.jpg\" width=\"299\" height=\"289\">\n            <hr />\n            <p class=\"Title\">Prof. Cory Bishop, PhD.</p>\n            <img src=\"People/Cory.jpeg\" width=\"299\" height=\"400\">\n            <p class=\"Text\">Associate Professor, Biology</p>\n            <p class=\"Text\">St. Francis Xavier University</p>\n            <a href=\"General/CV_Bishop.pdf\" target=\"_new\" class=\"nav-link_inline Text\">View my Curriculum vitae</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"HalfRight\">\n       \t  <p class=\"Title\">Welcome!</p>\n        \t<p class=\"Text\">Research in my laboratory is concerned with the ecology, development and evolution of aquatic organisms. We apply a wide variety of techniques from molecular phylogenetics, microscopy, organismal culture, pulse amplitude modulated fluorometry and experimental methods in physiology and gene expression. Visit the <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Research.html\" class=\"nav-link_inline\" target=\"_new\">research</a> and <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/People.html\" class=\"nav-link_inline\" target=\"_new\">people</a> sections for more details.</p>\n       \t  <div class=\"HalfRightWrap\">\n  \t\t    <p class=\"Title\">Bishop Lab News</p>\n \t\t    <hr />\n            <p class=\"Title\">Citizen Science Project Launched!</p>\n            <center><img src=\"Home/citizensciencesnap.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"223\"></center>\n            <p class=\"Text\"><a href=\"http://citizensciencens.ca\" target=\"_new\" class=\"nav-link_inline Text\">The Bishop Lab citizen science project</a> has been launched and is ready for your submissions!</p>\n            <p class=\"Text\">Find out more at <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Outreach.html\" target=\"_new\" class=\"nav-link_inline Text\">the citizen science section of this website</a> or visit <a href=\"http://citizensciencens.ca\" target=\"_new\" class=\"nav-link_inline Text\"> the brand new citizen science website</a> where you can learn more and submit your salamander and wood frog egg mass sightings.</p>\n            <p class=\"Text\">Don't forget to like our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/CitizenScienceNovaScotia\" target=\"_new\" class=\"nav-link_inline Text\">Facebook page!!</a>.</p>\n            <hr />\n            <p class=\"Title\">New publication and cover photo in <i>Phycologia</i></p>\n            <center><img src=\"Home/PhycologiaCover.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"700\"></center>\n            <p class=\"Text\"><b>Lin Y and Bishop CD</b> (2015) Identification of free living <i>Oophila amblystomatis</i> (Chlorophyceae) from Yellow Spotted Salamander and Wood Frog breeding habitat. <i>Phycologia</i> 54: 2: 183-191.</p>\n            <p class=\"Text\">See more Bishop Lab publications and request copies <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Publications.html\" class=\"nav-link_inline\" target=\"_new\"> here.</a></p>\n\t\t\t<hr />\n\t        <p class=\"Title\">New Photo Gallery Up and Running</p>\n            <center><img src=\"Gallery_Images/GalleryBanner.jpg\" width=\"650\" height=\"200\"></center>\n            <p class=\"Text\">We have been busy re-designing the Bishop Lab website over the last month. As part of the new website we have decided to include a photo gallery show casing some of the awesome pictures taken by Bishop Lab members. You will find salamanders, urchings, egg masses, field sites, and more <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Gallery.html\" class=\"nav-link_inline\" target=\"_new\"> here.</a></p>\n\t\t\t<hr />\n\t        <p class=\"Title\">Congratulations Bishop Lab M.Sc. students Katelyn MacNeil and Yuan Lin!</p>\n    \t    <p class=\"Text\">Bishop lab Msc students Katelyn MacNeil and Yuan Lin graduated from St.FX with a Masters in Biology on Saturday 6th December, 2014. Congratulations!</p>\n     \t    <hr />\n            <p class=\"Title\">Hot off the press!</p>\n       \t\t<a href=\"Home/News_Smalletal2014_FullPage.jpg\" class=\"nav-link\" target=\"_new\">\n           \t\t<center><img src=\"Home/News_Smalletal2014_Thumb.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"185\" /></center>\n       \t\t</a>\n            <p class=\"Text\">Visit the <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Research.htm #Publications\" class=\"nav-link_inline\">Publications Page</a> to see more Bishop Lab publications and request full text copies.</p>\n\t\t\t<hr />\n            <p class=\"Title\">Bishop lab student Scott Bennett co-authors paper</p>\n            <a href=\"http://www.stfx.ca/news/view/15566/\" class=\"nav-link\" target=\"_new\"><center><img src=\"Home/News_Scott.jpg\" width=\"650\" height=\"364\" /></center></a>\n            <p class=\"Text\">Scott is currently a third year undergraduate honours student at St. FX who has been working with the Bishop lab this last summer. His hard work and dedication certainly paid off, as he is now a co-author on his first scientific paper. Read more about Scott's achievements by clicking the image above, or check out the <a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Research.html\" class=\"nav-link_inline\">research section</a> of the website to find out more. Congratulations Scott, and here's to more of the same!</p>\n\t\t\t<hr />\n  \t\t\t<a href=\"http://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Archive.html\" class=\"nav-link_inline\">Old News Archive</a>\n \t\t\t<hr />\n            \n          </div>\n\t\t</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!--This code below is for the hit tracker. Start of StatCounter Code for Default Guide -->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\nvar sc_project=10177791; \nvar sc_invisible=1; \nvar sc_security=\"ae1cd37b\"; \nvar scJsHost = ((\"https:\" == document.location.protocol) ?\n\"https://secure.\" : \"http://www.\");\ndocument.write(\"<sc\"+\"ript type='text/javascript' src='\" +\nscJsHost+\n\"statcounter.com/counter/counter.js'></\"+\"script>\");\n</script>\n<noscript><div class=\"statcounter\"><a title=\"shopify\nanalytics ecommerce\" href=\"http://statcounter.com/shopify/\"\ntarget=\"_blank\"><img class=\"statcounter\"\nsrc=\"http://c.statcounter.com/10177791/0/ae1cd37b/1/\"\nalt=\"shopify analytics ecommerce\"></a></div></noscript>\n<!-- End of StatCounter Code for Default Guide -->\n\n</body>\n</html>\n", "http_status": 200, "error": "", "final_url": "https://people.stfx.ca/cbishop/Site/Home.html"}